der sie auf die Insel gebracht hatte.

00:03:25.335 --> 00:03:27.533
* Weiche Saiteninstrumentklänge *

00:03:58.935 --> 00:04:01.413
No, I will take this.
Okay, thank you.

00:04:17.695 --> 00:04:18.692
Mh.

00:04:30.415 --> 00:04:32.412
